  "tip": "<p>When a question stresses repeatability across many projects with strong parameterization and least privilege think in terms of <i>declarative</i> infrastructure as code. Look for options that support <i>templates</i>, <i>parameters</i>, and <i>idempotent</i> deployments rather than ad hoc scripts or custom orchestration.</p>",
